@host = https://localhost:7042
# Cambia doctorId por un id real de tu base: sale en la respuesta de GET /api/doctors
@doctorId = 43a43df8-d7dc-47e5-b82f-4baf36ca3fc3
@patientOne = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222201
@patientTwo = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222202

### 1. Lista de medicos
GET {{host}}/api/doctors

### 2. Horarios libres de un medico (lunes 12 de octubre de 2026)
GET {{host}}/api/doctors/{{doctorId}}/availability?date=2026-10-12

### 3. Reservar cita con el paciente 1  -> 201 Created
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{patientOne}}",
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "startTime": "2026-10-12T09:00:00-06:00",
  "reason": "Control general"
}

### 4. Mismo horario con el paciente 2 -> 409 Conflict (doble reserva bloqueada)
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{patientTwo}}",
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "startTime": "2026-10-12T09:00:00-06:00",
  "reason": "Consulta"
}

### 5. Horario fuera de la agenda (domingo) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{patientOne}}",
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "startTime": "2026-10-11T09:00:00-06:00"
}


### 6. Consultar paciente (debe dar 200)
GET {{host}}/api/patients/{{patientOne}}

### 7. Paciente que no existe (debe dar 404)
GET {{host}}/api/patients/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### 8. Consultar receta (debe dar 200)
GET {{host}}/api/prescriptions/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301

### 9. Receta que no existe (debe dar 404)
GET {{host}}/api/prescriptions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
